  "lines": {
    "Clip one. Watch for the hazard.": "audio/9fa40eb954be.mp3",
    "A single file is forming right in front of you. What do you do?": "audio/c2ffb49d6a20.mp3",
    "That's the Single File. One at a time, five deep, while nineteen feet of bar sits empty.": "audio/d5d196f4d3f7.mp3",
    "Correct. Point along the bar. Spread out, I'll come to you. Now you can see everyone, and so can the rest of the staff.": "audio/d43875857286.mp3",
    "Congratulations. You've built a post office. A bar is not a post office.": "audio/db06b7e023f8.mp3",
    "The Guinness has to settle. Someone else is waiting. What do you do?": "audio/3a442729cc42.mp3",
    "It settles without supervision. Meanwhile someone's been stood at the bar for two minutes, watching you watch a pint.": "audio/9315bbe58278.mp3",
    "They will notice. Everyone notices. Flat pint, long stare, bad review.": "audio/8e949820b168.mp3",
    "Correct. A Guinness settles on its own. Your hands are free, so take the next order while it does.": "audio/86f79df9db30.mp3",
    "Two people waiting. Who do you serve next?": "audio/b3b32d860b33.mp3",
    "Correct. The right one arrived first. You clocked them before you turned, and watched the middle one arrive in the mirror. Give the middle one a nod.": "audio/efdcfd956263.mp3",
    "Nearest is not next. The right one was here first. You saw them arrive before you turned round.": "audio/ff8b0f276396.mp3",
    "That's how you train a whole pub to wave. Never reward the tenner-waver.": "audio/67c8aa598020.mp3",
    "The card machine is connecting. Someone's waiting. What do you do?": "audio/82fd08fb3c03.mp3",
    "Staring doesn't help. It never has. Meanwhile someone on the right is holding a tenner and losing faith.": "audio/6faa33234a5a.mp3",
    "Correct. Hand it over, turn your head, take the next order. The machine doesn't need supervising.": "audio/ef48bff73de3.mp3",
    "And there it is. A single file, started by you, from behind the bar.": "audio/6b6f72025ef8.mp3",
    "Six drinks. One of them is a Guinness. What do you pour first?": "audio/ea5330e98a35.mp3",
    "Then five lagers go flat while the Guinness settles at the end, and everyone waits for the last pint.": "audio/5ad935ada4a5.mp3",
    "The freshest Guinness in London, and five warm lagers. Nobody has ever said thank you for that.": "audio/019994441252.mp3",
    "Correct. Guinness first. It settles while you pour the other five, and everything's ready at once.": "audio/4d353b2ef5e7.mp3",
